### 变量配置
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@projectId = proj_xxxxxxxx


### ==================== 创建项目 ====================

### 创建计划项目 (JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Q3 学习计划",
  "project_type": "PLAN",
  "deadline": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+08:00"
}

###

### 创建阅读项目 (Form-Data 上传文件)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

乡土中国项目
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deadline"

2026-09-30T00:00:00+08:00
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="乡土中国.epub"
Content-Type: application/epub

< ./乡土中国.epub
------FormBoundary--


### ==================== 查询项目列表 ====================

### 获取全部项目 (默认分页)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

###

### 按状态过滤 + 分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?status=ACTIVE&page=1&size=10

###

### 按类型过滤
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?type=PLAN

###

### 按类型 + 排序
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?type=READING&sort_by=updated_at&order=desc


### ==================== 获取项目详情 ====================

### 获取单个项目详情与任务树
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/detail


### ==================== 更新项目元数据 ====================

### 更新项目标题与截止时间
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的项目标题",
  "deadline": "2026-12-31T00:00:00+08:00"
}


### ==================== 项目状态流转 ====================

### 归档项目
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/archive

###

### 重激活已归档项目
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/reactivate


### ==================== 挂载任务树 ====================

### 对话完成后自动挂载任务树并激活项目
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/complete-plan-tree
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": "chain_01",
    "title": "第一阶段：基础知识",
    "tasks": [
      {
        "id": "task_01",
        "title": "阅读第1-3章",
        "estimated_hours": 4
      },
      {
        "id": "task_02",
        "title": "完成课后习题",
        "estimated_hours": 2
      }
    ]
  }
]


### ==================== 生成经验笔记 ====================

### 生成归档经验笔记 (空 Body 走默认值)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/experience-note
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 生成归档经验笔记 (带自定义参数)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/experience-note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "custom_prompt": "请重点总结本次阅读中的方法论收获"
}
